 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 President Trump speaks to the United Nations General Assembly in New York today. Photo: Alexi J. Rosenfeld/Getty Images 🇺🇳 In his UN address today, President Trump said he faces a choice between whether to make a deal with Iran or "annihilate the Islamic Republic." He also pushed rebranding "artificial intelligence" as "super intelligence." Go deeper . 🌊 Hurricane Polo rapidly intensified into a Category 5 storm off Mexico's Pacific coast, with maximum sustained winds of 160 mph. Polo's center is expected to stay offshore, but forecasters are warning of "life-threatening flooding and mudslides." Latest forecast . 🕯️ Hayden Panettiere died from an accidental overdose of several drugs, including fentanyl, per a South Carolina coroner. Get the latest . 
 
